<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-ATP WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ATP WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of round-robin group matches on the opening day of the ATP Tour world championship on Tuesday (prefix number denotes world ranking):</p>
<p>White Group</p>
<p>8-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat 2-Michael Chang (U.S.) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
